import{_ as n,o as i,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 862 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Intermingling and Protection of Myriad-Rank Cultures","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 862 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Intermingling and Protection of Myriad-Rank Cultures","no":862,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Cultural Intermingling","Cultural Protection","Cultural Diversity","Myriad Ranks"],"related":["52-Alien-Race Classification and Symbiosis","50-Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview","865-Cultural-Diversity Law Guarantee","861-Cultural-Construction Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.md","filePath":"en/0862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.md"}'),r={name:"en/0862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.md"};function o(s,e,l,u,c,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-862-transcended-ones-and-culture-intermingling-and-protection-of-myriad-rank-cultures" tabindex="-1">Entry 862 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Intermingling and Protection of Myriad-Rank Cultures <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-862-transcended-ones-and-culture-intermingling-and-protection-of-myriad-rank-cultures" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 862 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Intermingling and Protection of Myriad-Rank Cultures&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 50, 52, 861, 865</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-intermingling-is-not-assimilation-protection-is-not-isolation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: intermingling is not assimilation; protection is not isolation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-intermingling-is-not-assimilation-protection-is-not-isolation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: intermingling is not assimilation; protection is not isolation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank cultures are naturally colorful. Carbon-based humans have song and dance; plant spirits have growth rhythms; consciousness-information clans have dream art; mechanical-construct clans have structural aesthetics. The old world&#39;s strong ones, facing this diversity, have only two crude choices: either use force to force Myriad Ranks to &quot;civilize&quot; (assimilation), or treat alien clans as outsiders to isolate (discrimination). Heng Yuan Zhou must walk a third road — <strong>intermingle without assimilation, protect without isolation.</strong> This entry explains: how the transcended one lets each Myriad-Rank clan&#39;s culture both keep its own uniqueness and nourish each other in exchange.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: each clan&#39;s culture is equal, no high-low; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> opposes using culture as a weapon to conquer; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> lets cultural intermingling serve common progress; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires cultural exchange not forcibly change others; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires protection and intermingling principles be stable and self-consistent.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-difference-between-intermingling-and-assimilation" tabindex="-1">I. The Difference Between Intermingling and Assimilation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-difference-between-intermingling-and-assimilation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Difference Between Intermingling and Assimilation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is this entry&#39;s most critical divide:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Assimilation (Old World)</th><th>Intermingling (Heng Yuan Zhou)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Purpose</td><td>Let a few cultures cover the many</td><td>Each clan learns from each other</td></tr><tr><td>Result</td><td>Cultural simplification</td><td>Culture richer</td></tr><tr><td>Power relation</td><td>Strong culture crushes weak</td><td>Equal exchange</td></tr><tr><td>To Myriad Ranks</td><td>Loss of diversity</td><td>Richer symbiotic circulation</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Assimilation is &quot;I turn you into me&quot;; intermingling is &quot;we jointly grow something new.&quot; <strong>Heng Yuan Zhou wants the latter.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-protection-each-clan-s-culture-is-myriad-ranks-common-wealth" tabindex="-1">II. Protection: Each Clan&#39;s Culture Is Myriad Ranks&#39; Common Wealth <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-protection-each-clan-s-culture-is-myriad-ranks-common-wealth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Protection: Each Clan&#39;s Culture Is Myriad Ranks&#39; Common Wealth&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Protecting Myriad-Rank cultures is not &quot;preserving specimens,&quot; but recognizing:</p><ul><li>Each clan&#39;s culture is its unique understanding of the cosmos — a plant spirit&#39;s understanding of time is what humans cannot give;</li><li>Cultural extinction equals losing one way of seeing the world — this is Myriad Ranks&#39; common loss;</li><li>Weak clans&#39; cultures need protection more, because they most easily disappear under strong cultures.</li></ul><p>The transcended one takes the lead, providing endangered-clan cultures with documentation, transmission, and resource support, letting them continue growing within Myriad-Rank republicanism.</p><h2 id="iii-intermingling-let-culture-grow-in-exchange" tabindex="-1">III. Intermingling: Let Culture Grow in Exchange <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-intermingling-let-culture-grow-in-exchange" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Intermingling: Let Culture Grow in Exchange&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Protection does not mean sealing each clan&#39;s culture in a glass cabinet. Heng Yuan Zhou encourages intermingling:</p><ul><li>Myriad Ranks daily exchange on the cross-plane anchor network; cultures naturally influence each other;</li><li>Each clan&#39;s art (entries 846–850) learns from each other, producing new mixed art;</li><li>Symbiotic culture (entry 863) as the &quot;greatest common divisor,&quot; provides a common base color for diverse cultures.</li></ul><p>Intermingling&#39;s goal is not &quot;become the same,&quot; but &quot;find the common in the different, keep the different in the common.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-preventing-cultural-hegemony" tabindex="-1">IV. Preventing Cultural Hegemony <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-preventing-cultural-hegemony" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Preventing Cultural Hegemony&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Intermingling also has risks — strong cultures may imperceptibly crush weak cultures. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s defense line:</p><ul><li>Do not judge some clan&#39;s culture as &quot;higher&quot; — cultures have no superiority or inferiority, only character;</li><li>Leave sufficient protection resources and display space for weak cultures;</li><li>Cultural evaluation right belongs to each clan itself, not arbitrated by the transcended one or majority clans.</li></ul><p>This foreshadows entry 865&#39;s &quot;cultural-diversity law guarantee&quot; — it must write this protection into law.</p><p>The healthy sign of intermingling is both sides may &quot;take something&quot; from each other without losing themselves. A carbon-based race absorbing gas-form life&#39;s musical form, in turn fusing this musical form into its own rituals — this is intermingling; if this race&#39;s children from then on only listen to gas music and no longer tell their own clan&#39;s epics, that is being assimilated. The transcended one&#39;s role is not to act as referee stipulating who should influence whom, but to monitor intermingling&#39;s direction — when some culture&#39;s output shows overwhelming asymmetry (e.g., some human plane&#39;s cultural products occupy 80% of other planes&#39; attention), start cultural hedging mechanism, supporting weak-culture output channels. Intermingling must be free, but freedom&#39;s end may not be extermination.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: preserving Myriad-Rank diverse cultures preserves countless unique ways of seeing the world, not wasted in assimilation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: oppose cultural conquest and cultural hegemony; intermingle not assimilate</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo civilization centers on itself to assimilate alien clans; Heng Yuan Zhou lets Myriad-Rank cultures intermingle equally</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five-lineage each clan&#39;s culture is protected and may participate in intermingling</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cultural archives, intermingling mechanism, and protection policy all public network-wide</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-intermingling-and-protection-s-supervision-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Intermingling and Protection&#39;s Supervision and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-intermingling-and-protection-s-supervision-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Intermingling and Protection&#39;s Supervision and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Protecting diversity and promoting intermingling may not rely on good intentions alone. Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision continuously watches: whether strong cultures quietly crush weak cultures, whether endangered-clan cultures receive resources, whether intermingling is voluntary. The transcended one&#39;s work guarding cultural diversity is counted into civilizational weight by its effect of &quot;letting each clan be beautiful in its own way and all beauties together.&quot; This set of supervision lets the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm avoid the two extremes of assimilation and isolation — neither letting the strong conquer with culture, nor letting weak cultures wither in isolation. When Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual world is both rich and equal, Myriad-Rank republicanism truly becomes spiritual reality.</p><p>Intermingling and protection must also not forget Axiom 6: different life forms&#39; inherent basic infinities differ; plant spirits&#39; slowness, consciousness clans&#39; stillness, are all unique rhythms worth protecting, not to be crushed by a unified striver standard.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank cultures&#39; intermingling and protection is &quot;Myriad-Rank republicanism&quot; fulfilled in the spiritual domain. It neither lets the strong assimilate alien clans with culture, nor lets weak cultures wither in isolation; it lets each clan keep its uniqueness, yet nourish each other in exchange. When plant spirits&#39; growth rhythms, consciousness clans&#39; dream art, and humans&#39; song and dance are each beautiful on the symbiotic-culture base color and all beauties together, Myriad-Rank republicanism for the first time is no longer only a political arrangement, but spiritual reality.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/52-异族分类与共生.html">Entry 52 · Alien-Race Classification and Symbiosis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">Entry 50 · Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/865_模块4-超脱者与文化-文化多样性法则保障.html">Entry 865 · Cultural-Diversity Law Guarantee</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/861_模块4-超脱者与文化-总论.html">Entry 861 · Cultural-Construction Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=n(r,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
